{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝（Swisse Ultiboost Vitamin C + D Zinc &amp; Echinacea Effervescent）邊度買平？新假期整理萬寧及HKTVmall共2間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$32，約23%。</p>\n<h2>Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$108</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$108</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$140</td>\n<td>HK$140</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$108，較表列次低標價HK$140少HK$32。Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月16日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/swisse-ultiboost-vitamin-c-d-zinc-echinacea-effervescent-40pcs/p/242271\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E5%8D%9A%E6%9D%B1%E8%97%A5%E5%A6%9D/s/B1019002/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E5%85%8D%E7%96%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1/Swisse-Swisse-Ultiboost-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDC-D-%E9%8B%85%E7%B4%AB%E9%8C%90%E8%8F%8A%E6%B3%A1%E9%A8%B0%E7%89%87-40%E7%B2%92/p/B1019002_S_san-305\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>香港零售標籤列維他命C、維他命D、鋅及紫錐菊。維他命C參與人體正常合成膠原蛋白，亦有助正常免疫功能。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH：維他命C資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$140－HK$108）÷HK$140×100%計，約23%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179476325366394513_10691794546af9e9f637622.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝格價：HKTVmall HK$108，單盒約平23%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179476325366394513_10691794546af9e9f637622.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到Swisse Ultiboost維他命C D 鋅+紫錐菊泡騰片40片裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月16日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$108。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>只比較含維他命C、維他命D、鋅及紫錐菊的40片泡騰片，其他粒數及不同成分配方另計。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T17:45:32.510738+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":891,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T17:20:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T17:38:49.515620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T17:38:49.515620+00:00","content_hash":"30807666e840b726dce3b592f123a1b0d0195a39c0a8b17492e30797c46fe800","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}